{
  "page": 372,
  "lang": "ar",
  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 3044,
      "text": "Dia (Nuh) menjawab, \"Tidak ada pengetahuanku tentang apa yang mereka kerjakan.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 112,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 321,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3045,
      "text": "Perhitungan (amal perbuatan) mereka tidak lain hanyalah kepada Tuhanku, jika kamu menyadari.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 113,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 321,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3046,
      "text": "Dan aku tidak akan mengusir orang-orang yang beriman.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 114,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 321,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3047,
      "text": "Aku (ini) hanyalah pemberi peringatan yang jelas.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 115,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 321,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3048,
      "text": "Mereka berkata, \"Wahai Nuh! Sungguh, jika engkau tidak (mau) berhenti, niscaya engkau termasuk orang yang dirajam (dilempari batu sampai mati).\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 116,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 321,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3049,
      "text": "Dia (Nuh) berkata, \"Ya Tuhanku, sungguh kaumku telah mendustakan aku;",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 117,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 321,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3050,
      "text": "maka berilah keputusan antara aku dengan mereka, dan selamatkanlah aku dan mereka yang beriman bersamaku.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 118,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 321,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3051,
      "text": "Kemudian Kami menyelamatkan Nuh dan orang-orang yang bersamanya di dalam kapal yang penuh muatan.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 119,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 321,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3052,
      "text": "Kemudian setelah itu Kami tenggelamkan orang-orang yang tinggal.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 120,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 321,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3053,
      "text": "Sungguh, pada yang demikian itu benar-benar terdapat tanda (kekuasaan Allah), tetapi kebanyakan mereka tidak beriman.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 121,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 321,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3054,
      "text": "Dan sungguh, Tuhanmu, Dialah Yang Mahaperkasa, Maha penyayang.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 122,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 321,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3055,
      "text": "(Kaum) 'Ād telah mendustakan para rasul.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 123,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 322,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3056,
      "text": "Ketika saudara mereka Hud berkata kepada mereka, \"Mengapa kamu tidak bertakwa?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 124,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 322,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3057,
      "text": "Sungguh, aku ini seorang rasul kepercayaan (yang diutus) kepadamu,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 125,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 322,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3058,
      "text": "maka bertakwalah kepada Allah dan taatlah kepadaku.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 126,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 322,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3059,
      "text": "Dan aku tidak minta imbalan kepadamu atas ajakan itu; imbalanku hanyalah dari Tuhan seluruh alam.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 127,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 322,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3060,
      "text": "Apakah kamu mendirikan istana-istana pada setiap tanah yang tinggi untuk kemegahan tanpa ditempati,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 128,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 322,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3061,
      "text": "dan kamu membuat benteng-benteng dengan harapan kamu hidup kekal?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 129,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 322,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3062,
      "text": "Dan apabila kamu menyiksa, maka kamu lakukan secara kejam dan bengis.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 130,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 322,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3063,
      "text": "Maka bertakwalah kepada Allah dan taatlah kepadaku,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 131,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 322,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3064,
      "text": "dan tetaplah kamu bertakwa kepada-Nya yang telah menganugerahkan kepadamu apa yang kamu ketahui.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 132,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 322,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3065,
      "text": "Dia (Allah) telah menganugerahkan kepadamu hewan ternak dan anak-anak,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 133,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 322,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3066,
      "text": "dan kebun-kebun, dan mata air,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 134,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 322,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3067,
      "text": "sesungguhnya aku takut kamu akan ditimpa azab pada hari yang besar.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 135,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 322,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3068,
      "text": "Mereka menjawab, \"Sama saja bagi kami, apakah engkau memberi nasihat atau tidak memberi nasihat,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
